ed_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"1965年，英特尔前身仙童半导体研发总监戈登·摩尔随手画了条曲线：集成电路晶体管数量每18至24个月翻一番。这篇四页纸的文章，此后定义了万亿美元产业60年的节奏。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"1965年，英特尔前身仙童半导体研发总监戈登·摩尔随手画了条曲线：集成电路晶体管数量每18至24个月翻一番。这篇四页纸的文章，此后定义了万亿美元产业60年的节奏。","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"36d99968-1bdb-81c6-b11a-f5b6b27da691","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"36d99968-1bdb-81cf-bdcc-df4c7e9990c3"},"created_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"但今天，这条路越来越难走了。物理极限（量子隧穿）和经济极限（EUV成本翻倍）同时压上来，「后摩尔时代」已经徘徊了近20年。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"但今天，这条路越来越难走了。物理极限（量子隧穿）和经济极限（EUV成本翻倍）同时压上来，「后摩尔时代」已经徘徊了近20年。","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"36d99968-1bdb-81a3-b627-dc7b35b8facd","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"36d99968-1bdb-81cf-bdcc-df4c7e9990c3"},"created_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"heading_3","heading_3":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"两堵墙","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"c