se},{"object":"block","id":"36d99968-1bdb-8112-8235-c1ee18193857","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"36d99968-1bdb-81cf-bdcc-df4c7e9990c3"},"created_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"quote","quote":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"以「时间缩微」替代「几何缩微」，以系统性降低时间常数 τ 为目标，通过逻辑折叠等创新技术持续压缩信号传播时延，实现半导体与电子系统的持续演进。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"以「时间缩微」替代「几何缩微」，以系统性降低时间常数 τ 为目标，通过逻辑折叠等创新技术持续压缩信号传播时延，实现半导体与电子系统的持续演进。","href":null}],"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"36d99968-1bdb-8123-bbde-c87aec133658","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"36d99968-1bdb-81cf-bdcc-df4c7e9990c3"},"created_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"callout","callout":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"τ 是物理学时间常数符号，在数字电路中 delay = R × C。韬定律的核心洞见：决定芯片快慢的不只是管子数量，还有信号速度。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"τ 是物理学时间常数符号，在数字电路中 delay = R × C。韬定律的核心洞见：决定芯片快慢的不只是管子数量，还有信号速度。","href":null}],"icon":{"type":"emoji","emoji":"🔍"},"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"36d99968-1bdb-81c4-9937-e491da6a8939","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"36d99968-1bdb-81cf-bdcc-df4c7e9990c3"},"created_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-05-27T15:11:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_ed